---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { CONTACT } from '../config/site.mjs';
---
<Base
  title="Refer a Business to Prime Local Growth"
  description="Know a local business that needs more calls, bookings, or trust online? Introduce them to Prime Local Growth."
  path="/refer"
  ogTitle="Refer a Business to Prime Local Growth"
  ogDescription="Help a local owner get clearer visibility, stronger proof, and better follow-up."
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <a class="breadcrumb" href="/">Home</a>
      <p class="eyebrow">For past clients and partners</p>
      <h1>Know a good business that is being overlooked?</h1>
      <p class="lead">Introduce them to Prime Local Growth. We help local owners make it easier for the right customers to find, trust, and choose them.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href={`mailto:${CONTACT.email}?subject=Prime%20Local%20Growth%20referral`}>Make an email introduction</a>
        <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/results">See the work</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="narrow">
        <h2>A useful introduction, not a sales handoff.</h2>
        <p class="sub">Two lines in an email is enough. Adam takes it from there and is honest if the fit is not right.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="fix-rows" style="margin-top:40px;">
        <article class="fix-row">
          <h3>You send one email</h3>
          <p class="sub">Tell Adam who they are, what they do and where they serve. No forms, no commitment from you or from them.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="fix-row">
          <h3>Adam looks at their Google presence</h3>
          <p class="sub">He reviews their profile, reviews and competitors, then replies to them directly with a plain-English explanation of what is being missed.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="fix-row">
          <h3>They get an honest answer</h3>
          <p class="sub">A clear first step, scope and starting price, with no pressure and no long-term contract. If it is not a fit, they hear that too.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section alt">
    <div class="wrap narrow">
      <div class="cta-band">
        <div>
          <h2>Best for owners who want the work handled.</h2>
          <p>HVAC, plumbing, roofing, landscaping, automotive, salons, contractors, storage and other service businesses can start with a focused visibility review.</p>
        </div>
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href={`mailto:${CONTACT.email}?subject=Prime%20Local%20Growth%20referral`}>Email Adam</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
